  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Advancing together: Enhancing Civil Society Capacities for Rights,Inclusion and Local Action in Ferghana Valley, Uzbekistan</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;Overall objective (i.e. Impact):&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;To foster equitable and accountable local development in Uzbekistan through the active participation of civil society and youth.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Specific objective: To empower young civic actors and grassroots CSOs, primarily from three regions of Uzbekistan&#xbf;s Ferghana Valley to participate meaningfully in local decision-making and to contribute to democratic progress and accountability in Uzbekistan.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
